# heading, so two workers finishing at once never touch the same lines. union keeps both sides of an
# end-of-file collision instead of conflicting. Safe ONLY because every change is an append — an edit to an
# existing line would be merged by union without a conflict marker. See the file's header and
# ops/autonomous/tests/prove-done-union.sh.
SUITE_TODO_DONE.md merge=union
